sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PO as PayrollOfficer / HRManager
    participant CTRL as PayrollRunsController
    participant HF as Hangfire Scheduler
    participant W as PayrollGenerationWorker
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant FE as FormulaEvaluatorService (NCalc)
    participant WH as WebhookDispatcherService
    participant NOTIF as NotificationRecord

    PO->>CTRL: POST /payroll/runs<br/>{companyId, periodYear, periodMonth, runType}
    CTRL->>DB: INSERT PayrollRun (status=DRAFT)
    CTRL->>HF: enqueue job(payrollRunId)
    CTRL-->>PO: 202 { payrollRunId, status: DRAFT, jobId }

    HF->>W: Execute(payrollRunId)
    W->>DB: UPDATE PayrollRun.Status = GENERATING (transient)
    W->>DB: SELECT active EmployeePayrollProfiles<br/>(profile version active on period start date)

    loop for each employee (max 10 concurrent)
        W->>DB: load AttendanceSummary(employee, period)
        W->>DB: load LeaveSummary(employee, period)
        W->>DB: load active LoanInstallment / AdvanceRecovery
        W->>W: build FormulaContext<br/>(BaseSalary, WorkingDays, AbsentDays, ...)
        W->>DB: load SalaryStructureComponents<br/>ORDER BY Sequence ASC
        loop for each component in sequence order
            W->>FE: IsComponentApplicable? (AllowanceRule / DeductionRule)
            FE-->>W: true / false
            alt applicable
                W->>FE: Evaluate(FormulaExpression, context)
                FE-->>W: calculated amount
                W->>W: ComponentValues[code] = amount<br/>update running GrossSalary
            else not applicable
                W->>W: value = 0
            end
        end
        W->>DB: INSERT PayrollEntry (snapshot: name, IBAN, dept, ...)
        W->>DB: INSERT PayrollEntryComponent (one row per component,<br/>FormulaUsed = snapshot text)
    end

    alt some employees missing data
        W->>DB: mark those PayrollEntry.Status =<br/>AttendanceMissing / StructureMissing
    end

    W->>DB: aggregate & UPDATE PayrollRun<br/>(TotalGross, TotalDeductions, TotalNet)
    W->>DB: UPDATE PayrollRun.Status = GENERATED
    W->>WH: fire webhook "payroll.generated"
    W->>NOTIF: create notification for HR

    Note over W,DB: If the whole job throws unexpectedly,<br/>PayrollRun.Status = FAILED with error in<br/>Remarks — never left ambiguous (§15.6, §27.2)
